{"id":"651946","name":"辣白菜温拌苦瓜","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/651946/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苦瓜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"辣白菜","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"卤鸭心","amount":"6个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苦瓜洗净，去两头、去瓤，切薄片。","img":"images/651946/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将苦瓜放入一小锅水中烧开，沥出。","img":"images/651946/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"沥出的苦瓜用凉水冲洗几遍，挤掉多余水分。","img":"images/651946/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"拌入辣白菜。","img":"images/651946/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"我爸正好买了卤鸭心，我切上几个搭配一下。","img":"images/651946/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀，装盘即可。","img":"images/651946/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}